Echo tracker catalog (consent/tracker/catalog)

The catalog is MIT licensed like the rest of Echo. Its host, path and
cookie patterns are written from each vendor's own documentation, cited
in the sources: list of every file. No data from DuckDuckGo Tracker
Radar, Disconnect or Ghostery is used.

Some cookie names were cross-checked with the Open Cookie Database:

